SCOPE OF THIS FILE
==================

The MIT licence below is the licence of ai-job-search by Mads Lorentzen, from
which the job-search framework in this repository is derived. It covers that
material: everything under job-search/, the workflow text in .claude/ that was
adapted from it, and the files moved to this repository's root when the two
projects were merged (AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md,
SETUP.md).

It is reproduced here, at the root, because this repository keeps one set of
project files. It is not a statement about the licence of the rest of the
repository — the site, its data and the GJU German Year layer — which their
author has not licensed here. See .claude/NOTICE.md for what was taken and
where it landed.

